# Hits: a while-not-Eof / repeat-until-Eof loop whose body never advances the dataset (12, 32, 38),
# and a Continue that runs before the loop's Next (23); all reported under loop-condition-invariant.
# Non-hits: Next before the Continue (118, 124), Next / Delete present, Break leaves the loop, Next in a finally, the dataset handed to
# another routine, Continue after the Next.
loop-condition-invariant 12
loop-condition-invariant 23
loop-condition-invariant 32
loop-condition-invariant 38
!loop-condition-invariant 45
!loop-condition-invariant 54
!loop-condition-invariant 60
!loop-condition-invariant 70
!loop-condition-invariant 79
!loop-condition-invariant 84
!loop-condition-invariant 90
!loop-condition-invariant 94
!loop-condition-invariant 104
!loop-condition-invariant 110
!loop-condition-invariant 118
!loop-condition-invariant 124
